# Template for local operator use only — copy to .env and fill in real values.
# .env (and .env.*) is gitignored; never commit a filled-in copy of this file.
# See docs/THREAT_MODEL.md T5 for the security review of this key's usage.

# Supabase service-role key (bypasses Row-Level Security entirely). Required by:
#   - scripts/invite_user.js (operator-run invite CLI)
#   - analytics/c5_sentinel_sar_analytics_v1_1/export_live_incident.py
#   - supabase/functions/sync-log/index.ts (set as an Edge Function secret via the
#     Supabase dashboard/CLI, not read from this file — listed here for completeness)
# Never commit it, log it, or pass it as a bare CLI argument. Rotate via the Supabase
# dashboard (Project Settings -> API) if ever suspected exposed.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
